A coding assistant as a workflow: `kdeps run` opens a prompt, and each line is one agent turn that can read, edit and run files in the current folder.

```bash
kdeps run workflow.yaml
```

```text
> list the go files and fix the failing test
...
> /quit
```

- `resources/assistant.yaml`: the model and the tools the agent may call (`loop.tools`).
- `repl.sessionId` in `workflow.yaml`: the stored conversation. Change it to start a new one.
- File tools stay inside the folder you run from (or `KDEPS_WORKSPACE_ROOT`).
